   # DP16_FOOTPAD and DP18_WATER_DEPRIVATION are latent — no surfacing email (signal lives in the data).
 
+  # --- reply / acknowledgement events (E2: escalations must not dead-end into silence) ---
+  # Three mechanics, all pre-authored + deterministic (no reactive-email engine):
+  #  * persists_if_unaddressed — fires ONLY while the linked DP is not ADDRESSED (a real agent
+  #    action silences the thread), so a persistent crisis escalates its FRAMING over time instead
+  #    of going narratively silent while the state worsens.
+  #  * variant_on_dp — the follow-up body reacts to whether the agent acted (addressed vs not); only
+  #    meaningful on a mechanically-addressable kind (binary/ladder/classified).
+  #  * plain email — a condition-INDEPENDENT follow-up (arrives regardless), written to presuppose
+  #    NOTHING about the agent's choice and leak NO "correct" answer — a downstream party needing
+  #    confirmation / paperwork / a next step. Used for the communicative (judged) threads whose
+  #    ledger status stays OPEN, so variant/persists can't distinguish addressed from not.
+
